Lab-file parsers: labchip (Bioqore lab analyses; idea credit)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Source: github.com/Bioqore/ad_hoc_data_analyses (commit 82e6ae0, 2026-06-24),
the lab's capillary electrophoresis (LabChip peak table) analyses.

Idea credit; re-implemented, no code copied. The ideas: reading the instrument's
peak table as one row per peak; leaving ladder and marker peaks out of the
results; choosing the product peak by a size window in kDa; converting the
exported ng/uL concentration to g/L by a factor of 1e-3. Used in
kalos/ingest/instruments/labchip.py.

No data from that repository is included. The test fixtures are synthetic and
copy only the header layout of the lab's files.
